cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AgriTrust: a governance-infrastructure prototype for agrifood risk and payment discipline"
message: "If you use or refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mambozoukuni
    given-names: Jackson
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9343-1910"
    affiliation: "Auctus Agri"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JacksonMambo/agritrust-governance-prototype"
url: "https://jacksonmambo.github.io/agritrust-governance-prototype/"
abstract: >-
  A static, in-browser prototype demonstrating delivery capture, dispute
  handling, evidence anchoring, invoice sequencing, regulator traceability and
  a per-delivery tamper-evident event ledger for deferred-payment agrifood
  supply chains. Developed to accompany an Executive MBA capstone and released
  for open scrutiny.
keywords:
  - agrifood supply chains
  - payment discipline
  - tamper-evident ledger
  - traceability
  - GS1
  - governance
